74])},{index:'2',text:'Medium Dog',weight:'12 - 25 lbs',w_kg:'6 - 12 kgs',size:'80 - 120 cm',image:r(d[29])},{index:'3',text:'Large Dog',weight:'26 - 40 lbs',w_kg:'12 - 18 kgs',size:'120 - 180 cm',image:r(d[75])},{index:'4',text:'X-Large Dog',weight:'41+ lbs',w_kg:'19+ kgs',size:'180 - 250 cm',image:r(d[76])}];e.cards=Ie;e.passwordPolicy={point1:'At Least 8 Characters.',point2:'At Least One Number.',point3:'At Least One Lowercase & One Upercase Letter.',point4:'At Least One Special Character.'};e.dis_err_msg='Invalid Promo Code';e.inquiryAbout=[{value:'general',label:'General Inquiry'},{value:'Blog',label:'Blog Request'},{value:'pet_breeds',label:'Add Pet Breed Request'},{value:'marketing',label:'Sales/Marketing/Advertisement'},{value:'technical',label:'Press/Media Inquiry'},{value:'technical',label:'Technical Support'},{value:'abuse',label:'Report an Abuse'},{value:'other',label:'Others'}];e.petsCategory=[{value:'2',label:'Dog'},{value:'1',label:'Cat'},{value:'9',label:'Parrot'},{value:'7',label:'Bird'}];e.maxVideoTime='60';e.maxVideoSize='10485760';e.PMPVersion='v4.0.6';e.genderInfo='PetMyPal is commited to maintaining the same safe & inclusive environment for pet owners as for our team members. Addressing you by the correct pronoun is an important part of the commitment.';e.dobInfo='PetMyPal is a responsible company and complies with the U.S. law, Childrens Online Privacy Protection Act.';e.sharingStoriesText='Sharing pet stories was not that easy . Just create an account and use it like other social media sites.';e.aboutUsText="Pet lovers love their pets!! We love them both \u2013 the pets and the pet lovers!! So, we have built a social media community that encourages pet lovers to post, consume and engage with other pet lovers about their pets with photos, videos, chats, teams, groups and a whole lot more, throughout the world. We have blogs about pet health and live video blogs that will connect with other pet owners around the world in a live broadcast.\n\nWe know that most pet owners are busy and want to cherish every free minute with their pets. So, we went one step further by building tools that will give pet owners more free time to enjoy their pets by reducing the time required for basic pet care such as protecting their pets, connecting with pet professionals such as Vets, groomers, walkers and sitters and order pet food and supplies. Lastly, we realize that world without healthy, active pets will be a boring one. So, we plan to give back to the pet community through active pet charities.";e.whatisPetMyPal="We at PetMyPal are sad that you have initiated the Deactivation button.";e.deactivation_step1="Your account will not be visible on PetMyPal platform. Nobody will be able to search and follow you and your pets. This state will remain unless you re-activate your account within 90 days.";e.deactivation_step2="Upon 90th day, your account on PetMyPal will be removed.";e.deactivation_pass="Your PetMyPal password is required to start the deactivation process upon confirmation.";e.deactivation_proceed="Do you want to start Deactivation Process?";e.account_Deactivated="Please activate your account first";e.authText=" Social Media Platform devoted to pets and the pet owners. It's time to share your pet stories and memories with other pet owners alike.";e.pmpEco="PetMyPal provides the opportunity to boost your business within PetMyPal's ecosystem";e.videoTimeSize='Woof! Videos exceeds 10 MB or 1 minute duration.';e.reportPostText="Thank you for reporting the post. We will review it and remove if necessary.Your contribution to keep PetMyPal a safe place for all is very important.";e.phoneText='PetMyPal will use this number only for account security and recovery. Your number won\u2019t be visible to others. You can choose later whether to use it for other purposes.';e.editPhoneText='PetMyPal will use this number only for account security and recovery. Your number won\u2019t be visible to others.';e.ageText='Required to comply with Children\u2019s Online Privacy Protection Act in the US.';e.passwordText='Any combi`nation 8-20 characters of letters and numbers.';e.text1Pmp='The Free Social Media Platform';e.text2Pmp='devoted to pets and the pet owners.';e.text3Pmp="It's time to share your pet stories and";e.text4Pmp="memories with other pet owners alike.";e.options={title:'Upload Video',chooseFromLibraryButtonTitle:'Upload from gallery',takePhotoButtonTitle:'Upload from camera',mediaType:'video',quality:.5,storageOptions:{skipBackup:!0,path:'images',saveToPhotos:'true'}}},645,[1,646,647,648,649,650,651,652,653,654,655,656,657,658,659,660,661,662,663,664,665,666,667,668,669,670,671,672,673,674,675,676,677,678,679,680,681,682,683,684,685,686,687,688,689,690,691,692,693,694,695,696,697,698,699,700,701,702,703,704,705,706,707,708,709,710,711,712,713,714,715,716,717,718,719,720,721]);
